# The Windows release wheels are built from a core.autocrlf=true checkout, which
# is what gives their .py files CRLF line endings (descriptor_database.py is
# 6996 bytes / 177 CRLF in the public cp3x-win32/win_amd64 wheels). That
# conversion must NOT reach the test goldens: test_util.GoldenFile opens
# src/google/protobuf/testdata/** in binary mode and compares byte for byte.
src/google/protobuf/testdata/** -text
